# NOTE: node_modules is deliberately NOT excluded. The extension ships as
# unbundled out/*.js, so it still resolves express, the MCP SDK, zod and
# serialport from the installed tree at runtime. Excluding node_modules only
# becomes correct once the esbuild bundle in esbuild.js is switched on — see
# docs/packaging-esbuild.md for the allow-list that has to go with it.
